    {"id": "PH9-Palawan-Taytay", "zh": "泰泰", "status": "approved", "source": "@source/1a42ee59db3f31e2", "record_sha256": "7023ffad00fe4e42f24f50adfc9964e948de39a335fc9af3501e8afcb99c95b6", "review_notes": "Taiwan Office of the Philippine Department of Tourism publishes Taytay and 泰泰鎮 for northeast Palawan. Bare name as in Source. The existing 黎刹省 Taytay / 塔伊泰 is a separate place."},
    {"id": "PH9-Palawan-Dumaran", "zh": "杜马兰", "status": "approved", "source": "@source/890e24cb8640c913", "record_sha256": "0ba6335eface0de212e521ac8b9295b728698f2a09245af27e3cd78bd2ba2e10", "review_notes": "PSA identifies Dumaran municipality in Palawan. Published regional Chinese stem 杜马兰 in 杜马兰岛 supports project transcription; a Chinese authority has not certified the municipal name."},
